# ─── Phase 1: artifacts and synthetic data ───────────────────────────────────
# artifacts/ IS tracked on purpose. The service loads xgb_model.json and
# lstm.onnx at startup, so a fresh clone that lacks them cannot boot — which is
# exactly the bug phase 0 found. They are small (~240 KB together) and the
# *.joblib / *.h5 / *.keras rules above do not match them.

# A stray sidecar from torch's dynamo exporter would shadow the real weights.
artifacts/*.onnx.data

# Large synthetic training data: regenerate with `make train` (seeded).
data/synthetic/deals.csv
data/synthetic/activities.csv

# The small live demo set IS tracked — the hosted seed command needs it and
# running the generator on the deploy host is not worth the dependency.
!data/synthetic/live_deals.csv
!data/synthetic/live_activities.csv
